  "details": "1. open vrchat. open radious menu\n\n2. enable avatar debug panel in config\n\n3. close radious menu\n\n4. press PGUP/PGDN\n\nexcepted: debug panel scrolled up/down according to the panel's hint info\n\nactually: nothing happens\n\nThis prevents us from debugging complex avatars, especially with Face tracking, which has dozens of parameters and state machines working together.\n\nps: I remember these key worked well during Apr 2023.\n\nsystem: windows 10 22H2\n\nvrchat build 1390",
